---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import oldWay from "../../assets/problem-old-way.png";
import raceReady from "../../assets/problem-race-ready.jpg";
import raceReadyHover from "../../assets/problem-race-ready-hover.png";
---

<section class="band-light section" id="about">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="copy">
      <span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <h2>Most swimmers train everything but the moment that decides the race</h2>
      <p>You know your pace. You have done the sets. Your body is ready.</p>
      <p>
        But when the meet gets loud, the pressure builds, or the first split is
        not what you expected, your mind can pull you away from the race you
        trained to swim.
      </p>
      <p>
        Physical preparation gets you to the block. Mental preparation helps you
        trust your training when the moment arrives.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card card--old">
        <Image src={oldWay} alt="" class="bg-media" widths={[420, 700]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 420px" />
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>The old way:</h3>
          <p>Hope confidence shows up on race day.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card card--accent">
        <Image src={raceReady} alt="" class="bg-media" widths={[420, 700]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 420px" />
        <Image src={raceReadyHover} alt="" class="bg-media bg-media--hover" widths={[420, 700]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 420px" />
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>The Race Ready way:</h3>
          <p>Train confidence, focus, and composure like any other performance skill.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: var(--sp-content);
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Visual order is cards-then-copy; source order is copy-then-cards so the
     heading outline and the screen-reader reading order both stay correct. */
  .cards {
    order: -1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-sm);
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    min-height: 233px;
    padding: var(--sp-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-feature) 0 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--black);
  }

  /* Wash the photo out so the label stays readable without a heavy overlay. */
  .card :global(.bg-media) {
    opacity: 0.2;
    transition: opacity var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .card :global(.bg-media--hover) { opacity: 0; }

  .card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--black) 0%, transparent 100%);
    mix-blend-mode: color;
    transition: background var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .card-body { position: relative; z-index: 2; }

  .card h3 {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: var(--type-card-title);
  }

  .card p {
    margin-top: var(--sp-paragraph);
    font-size: var(--type-body-16);
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    max-width: 34ch;
  }

  .card--accent {
    border-width: 0 0 0 2px;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius-feature) 0;
  }
  .card--accent h3 { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .card--old:hover :global(.bg-media) { opacity: 1; }
  .card--old:hover::after { background: var(--black); }
  .card--old:hover h3 { color: var(--white); }
  .card--old:hover p { color: var(--color-text); }

  .card--accent:hover :global(.bg-media:not(.bg-media--hover)) { opacity: 0; }
  .card--accent:hover :global(.bg-media--hover) { opacity: 1; }
  .card--accent:hover::after {
    background: linear-gradient(0deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--black) 80%, transparent), transparent 65%);
    mix-blend-mode: normal;
  }
  .card--accent:hover h3,
  .card--accent:hover p { color: var(--white); }

  .tick {
    display: block;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-sm);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    clip-path: polygon(0 60%, 38% 100%, 100% 12%, 82% 0, 36% 66%, 14% 46%);
  }

  .copy h2 { max-width: 20ch; }

  .copy p {
    margin-top: var(--sp-paragraph);
    font-size: var(--type-body-16);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .copy p:first-of-type { margin-top: var(--sp-med); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-lg);
    }
  }
</style>
